#: ../../source/readme_rosetta.rst:24
msgid "readme_rosetta.markdown_handler module"
msgstr ""
"**Module:** readme_rosetta.markdown_handler\n"
"**Description:** \n"
"\n"
"*   **Purpose**: Provide Markdown support for rosetta (Rosetta is a set of tools to translate text between many languages.)\n"
"*   **Description**: markdown\\_handler  - rosetta's built-in Markdown processor. It supports common Markdown syntax and will break it down into its constituent parts, which can be used by other modules.\n"
"    *   `__call__`: Handle the rendering of markdown in a string\n"
"    *   `render_to_string(markdown_text, options={}) -> str:`\n"
"        *   Returns the rendered text\n"
"\n"
"**Methods**\n"
"### render\\_to\\_string\n"
"*   **Purpose**: Render markdown from input string.\n"
"*   **Parameters**\n"
"    *   `markdown_text`  - The input text to be converted into HTML\n"
"    *   `options`  - A dictionary of options with the key 'autolink' equal to True\n"
"\n"
"**Methods**\n"
"### __call__\n"
"*   **Purpose**: Render markdown in a given string.\n"
"*   **Parameters**\n"
"\n"
"    | Parameters | Types |\n"
"    :-----------|:------|\n"
"    | markdown_text | str |\n"
"    | *options*  | dict |\n"
"\n"
"        **Options:**\n"
"            - 'autolink': bool"

